Package: carpeDIAMS
Title: Pseudo-DDA MS2 Spectra from bbCID Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Johan", "Lassen", email = "johan@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Builds pseudo-DDA MS2 spectra from broadband CID (bbCID) LC-MS
    data. MS2 centroids near each precursor are grouped by m/z, and groups
    whose intensity tracks the precursor's MS1 elution profile are kept.
    Works from a grouped 'xcms' object, mzML files with a target list, or a
    single mzML file, and writes one MGF block per feature.
